## m-4 (XRv9000): 先に VRF CUST-T だけ作ってコミット → 別のコミットで G3 を CUST-B から CUST-T へ → 30 秒 → ping
configure
RP/0/RP0/CPU0:XR01(config)#
vrf CUST-T
RP/0/RP0/CPU0:XR01(config-vrf)#
address-family ipv4 unicast
RP/0/RP0/CPU0:XR01(config-vrf-af)#
commit
RP/0/RP0/CPU0:XR01(config-vrf-af)#
end
RP/0/RP0/CPU0:XR01#
configure
RP/0/RP0/CPU0:XR01(config)#
interface GigabitEthernet0/0/0/3
RP/0/RP0/CPU0:XR01(config-if)#
vrf CUST-T
RP/0/RP0/CPU0:XR01(config-if)#
commit
RP/0/RP0/CPU0:XR01(config-if)#
show configuration failed
% No such configuration item(s)
RP/0/RP0/CPU0:XR01(config-if)#
end
RP/0/RP0/CPU0:XR01#
show ipv4 vrf all interface brief | include "0/0/0/3"
GigabitEthernet0/0/0/3         172.16.21.1     Up              Up       CUST-T  
RP/0/RP0/CPU0:XR01#
